Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点好吗 迈克 你搞得我不舒服\NHey slow down Mike okay You're making me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是你害我们迟到 我会慢点的\NI would slow down if you hadn't already made us late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.89,0:01:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没迟到好吗 是你太紧张\NWe're We're not late okay You're just anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.68,0:01:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我紧张是因为你害我们迟到\NNo I'm anxious 'cause you made us late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.10,0:01:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我下半生一定不会和你一起这样做\NI'm not doin' this with you in the next phase of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须尊重我的时间\NYou're gon' respect my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:01:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的肚子\NMy stomach My stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 马上在那家店前停车\NHey Mike look pull over at that store right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要姜汁汽水\NI need a ginger ale.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没时间买姜汁汽水 老兄\NLook we don't have no time to get no ginger ale man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 迈克 我不舒服\NCome on Mike I'm sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你吓死我了 知道吗\NYou're freaking me out okay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.03,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我快要吐了\NI feel like I'm gonna throw throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.42,0:02:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我挑战你 马克斯\NI dare you Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.89,0:02:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你有90秒 知道吗\NYou got 90 seconds all right
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只能买姜汁汽水\NGinger ale and nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个成人好吗\NI am a grown ass man okay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对我好点吧\NJust be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 85秒\NOh Okay 85 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那些热狗新鲜吗\NAre those dogs fresh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:02:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天才摆出来的\NI put 'em on yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,给我一个 上面放点佐料和芥末\NWell give me one and put some relish and some mustard on that motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,拿起来 来 快点\NHook it up Come on hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那边那个 对 那个 快点\NNo that one right there Yeah Yeah that right there Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,该走了\NGotta go gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别慢吞吞的\NDon't be takin' your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.69,0:03:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就这样嘛\NYeah my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,打开收银机\NHey open the register.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止逗留
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不 马上\NNo no no Now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你选错日子了\NSir today is not the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\NShut the fuck up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.74,0:03:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看 如果我不在15秒之内上车\NLook if I'm not in that car in 15 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有个脾气暴躁的男人会进来 我们都完蛋了\Nthere's a very surly man that's comin' in here and we both are fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯 别动\NMarcus Hey don't fuckin' move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,过去\NThe fuck over there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.59,0:03:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 我跟这人说了我必须走了\N'Ey Mike I told this guy I had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,柜台上那是彩虹糖吗 马克斯\NIs that Skittles on the counter Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他花了很久时间卖我姜汁汽水\NWell he was takin' a long time with the ginger ale.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 他进来时就马上拿了姜汁汽水\NThat is incorrect He grabbed that ginger ale the second he came in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止逗留\N不对 他进来时就马上拿了姜汁汽水\NThat is incorrect He grabbed that ginger ale the second he came in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止逗留\N是热狗吗 马克斯\NA hot dog Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是热狗吗 马克斯\NA hot dog Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不该吃那鬼东西\NYou're not supposed to be eatin' that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我的 迈克 对 给你的\NThis is not mine Mike Yes it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:04:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你别多管闲事\NMind your business with your tattletaling ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都闭嘴\NEverybody shut the fuck up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你必须把武器放下\NSir I'm gonna need you to lower your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你来拿我的武器吧\NCome take my weapon then motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟他作对\NDon't antagonise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯 上车\NMarcus get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 他拿枪指着我的头\NMike he has a gun to my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你想对付他 还是我\NWanna deal with him you wanna deal with me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生 我必须走了\NSorry sir but I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必向他开枪 迈克\NYou didn't have to shoot him Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,上车\NGet in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,打911\NCall 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不是警察\NAren't you the police
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,绝 地 战 警 生死与共
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,别人眼里的你\NOther people look at you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看到的是量身定制的西装 汽车 手表\Nand see the tailored suits the cars the watches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们相识时 那一切都不存在\NI met you without any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,一丝不挂 基本上是赤身裸体\NStripped basically naked
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那是90%我嫁给你的原因\Nwhich is 90% of why I'm marrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我在你最低谷时遇见了你\NI met you at your lowest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.76,0:05:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你中了枪\NYou'd been shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但你内心的火\NBut there was a fire in you that was
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是非凡的\Nextraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓要用余生来煽动那股火焰\NAnd I vow to spend the rest of my life fanning that flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我宣布\NI now pronounce you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.65,0:05:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们结为夫妻\Nhusband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以吻新娘\NYou may kiss the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\NYes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我好喜欢\NI love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他在中枪后与治疗师结婚是有道理的\NYou know it kinda makes sense that he married his therapist after he got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢他一点 心理健康非常重要\NI love that for him Mental health is super important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他的物理治疗师\NWell it was his physical therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜 迈克 丽塔 谢谢你\NCongratulations Michael Rita Thank you thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,市长先生\NMr Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,说早了就不灵了 我仍然只是个卑微的美国律师\NOh not yet Don't jinx it I'm still just a lowly US Attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在关注你的工作\NI've been watching what you're doin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我支持你 谢谢\NYou got my vote Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你\NCongratulations to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就是金童玉女\NI mean the definition of a power couple right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我去帮你拿饮料 好\NI'll grab you a drink Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么吗 不 不需要 谢谢\NCan I get you anything No I'm good thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一直以来 我都以为你至死都是单身汉\NAnd all this time I thought you were a terminal bachelor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这一次我自己也始料不及\NI I I even surprised myself with this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你一直没遇见对的人\NYeah I guess you just hadn't met the right one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候我还有待成长\NI had some growing up to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,当时你已经50岁了\NYou were 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.97,0:06:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我得为他所说的一切预先道歉\NI'm gonna pre apologise for whatever he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\NMike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.73,0:06:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你也知道的 马克斯\NNo you know how it is Don't Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯 让我说出来\NMarcus Come Let me get it out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 兄弟\NCome on man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你经历了那么多 好吧\NEverything you have been through man Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,女巫 巫师\NThe witch The Bruja.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,妓女\NThe prostitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹妹 记得吗 你应该跟我说我妹妹的事 迈克\NMy sister 'Member You coulda told me about my sister Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你早该告诉我的\NYou coulda told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她对你有感觉 我会拥抱你的\NI would've embraced you if that's who she was feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 迈克 无庸置疑\NI love you Mike No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如果警监还活着 他一定想亲眼目睹这一幕\NYou know Cap would've loved to have been here to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但你知道吗\NBut you know what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到了他的女儿朱迪和孙女凯莉\NWe got his daughter Judy and his granddaughter Callie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她有话想说\NShe wants to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我爷爷很爱大家\NMy grandad loved you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.77,0:07:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他在这里 他会说不要把这件事搞砸\NAnd if he were here he would have told you not to F this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他会这么说的\NThat's what he would've said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 他会说 别搞砸了\NYeah he woulda said Don't fuck it up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\NExactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我说脏话了\NOh excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N'Ey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 我们成为拍档一段时间了\NMike you been my partner a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是 先生\NYes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他将成为你的伴侣 克莉斯丁\NNow he's gonna be your partner Christine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,祝贺迈克和克莉斯丁·劳瑞\NTo Mike and Christine Lowrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.97,0:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一辈子 一辈子\NFor life For life
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.23,0:08:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 马克斯\NGo Marcus Go Marcus Go Marcus Go Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\NOh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\NWhat happened What happened
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.04,0:08:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯\NMarcus Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的地址是什么\NWhat's the address
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,让我进去 退后\NLet me in let me in let me in Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是丽塔·塞卡达警监 有一名警官心脏骤停\NThis is Captain Rita Secada I have an officer in cardiac arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.24,0:08:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\NCome on man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你的死期还没到\NIt's not your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯\NMarcus
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,马克\NMarc Marc
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙\NThis guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们\NHey buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\NWhat you doing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我一生都在害怕之中 迈克\NI spent my whole life being scared Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我浪费了太多时间\NI wasted so much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,请你从边缘退后一点\NWhy Why Why don't you Why don't you just step back from the edge a little bit please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是哪一年\NWhat year is it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是星期二\NIt's Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你扭着屁股昏倒的同一年\NSame year your ass was wobbling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 感觉已经有五年了\NOh wow Felt like it was five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我处于海洋的底部\NI was in the basement of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我所有的烦恼都消失了\NAll my bullshit was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,唯有自由\NJust freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还有完全充满爱 迈克\NAnd full body love Mike Full body love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.15,0:11:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不如你\NWhy Why Why don't you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,以爱让你全身从边缘回来好吗\Nlove your full body back from the ledge please
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么好怕的\NNothing to be scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的时间还没到 宝贝\NIt's not my time baby It's not my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,伯内特先生\NMr Burnett
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我看着他\NHey I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是\NHe's just
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:12:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他到底在干嘛\NI don't know what the fuck he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但我看着他了 我们没事\NBut I got it I got him We're good We are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.89,0:12:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很好\NWe are great 'Ey
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,迈阿密\NMiami
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,305一辈子\N305 for life
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,唰唰\NKakow
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,停 你那东西会闪瞎别人的眼睛\NAll right Just stop You gon' put somebody's eye out with that thing man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我在唤醒我的原始能量 迈克\NI'm bringing the thunder Mike I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,唤醒能量\NBringing the thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好 就是这样\NAll right There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,来抱抱\NOh man Bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我已经失去你了 兄弟\NThought I lost you brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你的人生少不了我\NCouldn't lose me if you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你的屁股露出了吧\NYou know your ass is out right
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大家的屁股都露出来了 迈克\NEverybody's ass is out Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一场暴风雨要来了\NThere's a storm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.59,0:12:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是那种暴风雨\NNo Not that kind of storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.51,0:12:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你会经受考验\NYou're gonna be tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.68,0:12:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,事情会变得糟糕\NThings are gonna get bad
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你将不得不做出一个非常艰难的选择\Nand you're gonna have to make a really hard choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需记住 你很厉害\NJust know you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的私人时间 麦格拉斯先生\NThis is my private time Mr McGrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,请问有什么能帮到你的吗\NHow may I help you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你转一些钱 你的钱\NI need you to move some money Your money
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.93,0:13:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是你老板的 我要贩毒集团现金\NYour boss's actually I need it to be cartel cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不到两千万\NJust under 20 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,回溯那账户从2004年到2020年1月的\NBackdated series of transfers beginning 2004 ending January 2020
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一系列\Ninto
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,转账\Nthat account.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.94,0:13:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,以已故康拉德·霍华德警监的名义\NIn the name of the late Captain Conrad Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我有负责物流的人\NI have people who can handle logistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.15,0:13:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要你的登录信息\NI really just need your log in credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要给你这些\NAnd why would I give you those
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\NOh my God
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 亲爱的\NCome here darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,来\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\NCome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,【面部识别】
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,手机无法转账\NYou can't transfer funds from a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 怎么了\NHey honey what's going on
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,她们互相认识吗\NDo they know each other
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 谁在你身边\NHoney who's there with you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好 亲爱的\NAll right all right Honey
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,转账开始了\NHere we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,资金转移 转至:康拉德·霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会为此杀了你\NThey'll kill you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.71,0:14:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会知道事情的经过\NThey're not even gonna know this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你的女友听见你和你太太的电话\NYour girlfriend heard you on the phone with your wife
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.47,0:14:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,发现你根本没打算和她离婚\Nand realised you were never gonna divorce her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:15:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她一怒之下开枪射杀了你\NAnd in a fit of passion she shot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你的保镖试图介入 但已经来不及了\NYour bodyguard tried to step in but he was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,当她意识到她那恐怖的行为\NAnd realising the horror of her actions
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她自杀了\Nshe took her own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\NNo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你在干什么\NHoney what are you doing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,两星期前你才心脏病发作 没错\NYou had a heart attack two weeks ago Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他们称其为寡妇制造者是有原因的 你该留在医院 宝贝\NThey call it a widow maker for a reason You need to be in the hospital baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我尝试说过他了\NHey I tried to told his ass T.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,显然 他已经是成年人了 他获准自行出院\NApparently he's an adult He was allowed to sign hisself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.98,0:15:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 别这样 我一刻也无法忍受离开你\NHey babe Look come on I couldn't take one more second away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我体内的支架让我血脉喷张\NAll these stents in me got my blood flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.19,0:15:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我在回家途中 好吧\NI'm on D way All right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.15,0:15:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 那是我的电话\NEy Ey Come on man That's my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 马克斯 我们10分钟后到\NI love you Marcus We'll be there in 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 宝贝 爱你\NAll right babe All right Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 迈克\NHey Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我没打算告诉你\NI wasn't even gonna tell you this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.21,0:16:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们不是第一次了\Nbut this ain't the first time we done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们时常同车 你是什么意思\NWe ride together all the time what you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是说我们的灵魂\NNo I'm talking about our souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们曾一起同车 但我看到了全部 迈克\NYou know we've ridden together but I saw it all Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们注定携手同行 已经做了好几辈子的生死搭档\NWe're bound And we have been for lifetimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.01,0:16:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并不总是叫迈克和马克斯 但我们的灵魂不曾改变\NWe haven't always been Mike and Marcus but we've always been us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么\NWhat you talking 'bout
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是灵魂伴侣\NWe're soulmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.65,0:16:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是 是的\NYup Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为的灵魂伴侣看起来有点不同\NYeah I kind of I saw my soulmate looking a little different than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 你被困在肉体里\NSee See Mike you stuck in the physical.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,灵魂没有鸡鸡\NSouls don't have dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我蛮肯定我的灵魂有鸡鸡 马克斯\NI'm pretty sure my soul has a dick Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 就是这些废话 所以我们才被困住\NSee That's that shit right there That's why we're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来也没打算告诉你这个\NYou know I wasn't gonna tell you this shit either
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.38,0:16:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的灵魂比你的先进多了\Nbut my soul is more advanced than your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说你的灵魂很笨\NIt's not that your soul is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗\NYou know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.39,0:17:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,只是你比较像是婴儿灵魂 知道吗\NIt's just that you're more like a baby soul You know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而我比较像是母亲的灵魂\NAnd I'm more like a mother soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想给你喂奶\NAnd I just gotta suckle ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 让你吸奶\NYou know Put you on that titty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.99,0:17:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗\NYou know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得你的大脑缺氧多久了\NHey How long you think your brain went without oxygen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.07,0:17:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸回来了\NDaddy Daddy's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 宝贝 你回来了 我的家人呢 我的家庭\NBaby Oh baby you're back Where my family My family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝\NHey baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,小马克斯\NLittle Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,跟奶奶和爷爷说嗨\NSay hi to Pop pop Say hi to Grandad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我好想你 你看你 女人\NI missed you so Look at you woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别这样 看着我 宝贝\NNo come on look at me baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.81,0:17:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得让他们冷静下来\NWe're gonna have to hose them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们知道了\NAll right All right we get it We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,放点冰在你的内裤什么的\NPut some ice in your drawers or somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真好笑\NThat's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你感觉好吗 马克斯\NAre you feeling good Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我一生中从未感觉如此好过\NI never felt better in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯 我太想你了 亲爱的 但你必须休息\NOh Marcus I missed you so much honey but you need to get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.25,0:18:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不 宝贝 我需要你\NOh no baby I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.75,0:18:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,让我去补充一些电解质 好的 宝贝 给我一个吻\NJust let me get some electrolytes Okay baby Give me a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸怎么了\NSo what's going on with my dad
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他赤裸地站在屋顶上\NWell he was on the roof naked
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他还说他去了海床\Nand he said he had been at the basement of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇鹰嘴豆\NAmazing Chickpeas
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 他说我有个很笨的婴孩灵魂\NOh and he said I have a stupid baby soul
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.81,0:18:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有鸡鸡\Nwith no penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们必须和他谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 雷吉 是 长官\NHey Reggie Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你吃了我的零食 没有 长官\NDid you eat my snacks No sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.03,0:18:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我正期待着我的零食 雷吉\NI was looking forward to my snacks Reggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\NHoney.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你该去找份工作\NYou know what You need to get a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是一名美国海军陆战队员 长官\NI'm a US Marine sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你该被调派出去\NWell then you need to deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚从也门回来\NYou know we just got back from Yemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你为国效力\NThank you for your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我死了 对吗 死了\NYou thought I was dead didn't you Dead
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有一件事你不知道 雷吉\NOne thing you don't know Reggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这安了一台监控 对吧\NI got a camera up in here Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,特丽莎\NTheresa
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是医生吩咐的 马克斯 你要严格节食 无盐 无糖 无脂肪\NIt's the doctor's orders Marcus You're on a strict diet No salt no sugar no fats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不能有压力 吵闹声 消耗体力\NNo stress no loud noises no physical exertion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你随便坐下就是了\NJust sit your ass down somewhere man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.07,0:19:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他 迈克\NTell him Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 亲爱的 我和你一起做 现在我们是素食者\NAnd honey I'm doing it with you We're now vegetarians.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,素食者 看着我\NVegetarians Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你看我这体魄 宝贝 我现在宛如新生\NLook at all this man baby I'm brand new.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要动物糖分来生存\NI need animal sugars to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝\NWell baby
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我留了沙拉给你\NI have a salad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,沙拉\NA salad
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,特丽莎 看来一切在你掌控之中 我的任务也完成了\NHey T looks like you got this under control My tour of duty is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 克莉斯丁 再见 迈克 再见 两位\NBye Christine Bye Mike Bye guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 等一下\NHey Mike Wait up Wait up wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去做什么 能帮我跑一下腿吗\NWhat you about to do Can you run a quick quick for me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好 你需要什么\NYeah what you need
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你$1000 买一些彩虹糖\NI'll give you $1 000 for some Skittles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:20:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯 我不会买糖给你\NMarcus I am not buying your ass no candy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好 $2000 迈克 再来点叮当蛋糕 这可是极高的报价\NOkay $2 000 Mike for some Ding Dongs And that's my final offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.91,0:20:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你别想有叮当了\NI think you're gonna be Ding Dong less
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就如我的灵魂一样\Nlike my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是带走我爱的人\NYou always take whoever I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我是迈克·劳瑞警探\NThis is Detective Mike Lowrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.95,0:20:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,警监倒下了\NThe Captain is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我儿子\NHe's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你的家庭一团糟 迈克\NYou got a fucked up family Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,【突发新闻】
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,司法部一直对迈阿密警察局的贪污问题进行调查\NThe Department of Justice has been investigating the corruption in the Miami Police Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们拥有可靠的情报\NAnd we now have credible intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.95,0:21:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,当年是康拉德·霍华德警监指挥警员\Nthat Captain Conrad Howard was directing these elements
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,与贩毒集团合作\Nin coordination with the cartels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我对大约什么时候不感兴趣\NNo I'm not interested in approximately what time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要知道确切时间 明白吗\NI need to know exactly what time do you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直知道这件事\NYou knew about this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我两个星期前才知道\NI found out two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,记者会说的 是真的吗\NA press conference Really
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾你们通过这种方式得知\NI'm sorry about the way you had to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.22,0:21:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但考虑到你们的密切关系 我们的密切关系\NBut given your closeness Our closeness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.93,0:21:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有霍华德警监 你们谁也没有工作\NNeither one of y'all would have a job if it wasn't for Captain Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,丽塔 你知道事情不是这样的\NRita you know this is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,坦白说 我不知道\NHonestly I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,调查发现了新的证据\NThe investigation has turned up new evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.57,0:22:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,迈阿密执法部门多年来出了不少岔子\NMiami law enforcement's been a leaky ship for years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,证人死亡 线人失踪\NWitnesses turn up dead informants disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,事件看起来是随机的 直到你汇总几年内发生的事\NEvents appear random until you aggregate them over a period of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.16,0:22:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就会看见一种模式\NThen a pattern emerges.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他是谁\NWho is this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.75,0:22:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,巴德·格莱斯 联邦调查局局长 此次调查组的领导\NBud Grice FBI heading up the JTF on this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我\NThat's who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道有人在提供情报\NNow we knew someone was providing intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.01,0:22:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,给运毒品到南佛罗里达州的毒贩\Nto a cartel moving product into South Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是不知道是谁\NWe just didn't know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.26,0:22:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,两周前 一名毒品集团的银行家被女友枪杀身亡\NA cartel banker turned up dead two weeks ago shot by his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.39,0:22:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他们找到一部手机 上面有霍华德的联系方式\NThey found a phone with Howard's contact on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.81,0:22:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,与毒贩多年的联系 还有海外银行账户信息\NYears of communication with the cartel account references offshore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.19,0:22:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在霍华德的名下有数百万美元\NMillions in Howard's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,通过这些证据 终于可以给那贪腐的混蛋定罪了\NFinal piece we needed to nail that dirty motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.32,0:22:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,格莱斯 噢 哇 听我说\NGrice Oh whoa Hey hey let me holler at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.78,0:22:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他倒下时我就在他身边 对吗\NYou know I was with him when he went down right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你再说他贪腐试试\NCall him dirty one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.87,0:22:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你有种就说\NI dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.58,0:23:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道还有其他人和他一伙 我们也会找到他们\NWe know he had others who were with him We're gonna find them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.29,0:23:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,和他一伙的人是我\NI was with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就给我上手铐 我当时和他在一起 迈克\NPut the cuffs on me right now I was with him Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.55,0:23:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这些混蛋认为他死了 无法替自己辩护\NNo these motherfuckers think that just 'cause he's dead and can't defend hisself
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.05,0:23:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就把所有问题推到他身上 毁了他的传奇\Nthey gon' dump all this shit on him burn his legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,有我在就不行\NNot on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我是朱迪·霍华德 美国法警\NThis is Judy Howard US Marshals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.35,0:23:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我在这里没有管辖权\NI realise I have no jurisdiction here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.69,0:23:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但出于职业礼貌\NBut as a professional courtesy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.36,0:23:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我想申请了解针对我父亲的指控的来源\NI'd like to request visibility into the sources of the allegations against my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.45,0:23:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,朱迪\NJudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会解决这问题的 好吗\NWe're gonna figure this shit out all right
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.33,0:23:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莉还好吗\NHow's Callie
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 迈克\NHow do you think Mike
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.70,0:23:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都在同一条船 朱迪\NWe're on the same team here Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不是 迈克\NLike hell we are Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.29,0:23:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是你的混蛋儿子 我爸爸应该还活着\NMy dad would still be alive if it weren't for your bastard son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.59,0:23:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,朱迪\NJudy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我在街上见到他 我以我父亲发誓\NIf I ever catch him out on the street I swear on my father
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.38,0:23:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我会杀了他\NI will put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.64,0:23:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\NCome on Come on man Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:24:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,【迈阿密警察局】
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.35,0:24:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来该怎么办\NSo what's our next move\N【迈阿密警察局】
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.64,0:24:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,【迈阿密警察局】\N他们说他和毒贩合作 我们去问毒贩吧\NThey said he was working with the cartel Let's ask the cartel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.71,0:24:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说他和毒贩合作 我们去问毒贩吧\NThey said he was working with the cartel Let's ask the cartel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,联邦监狱 佛罗里达州中部
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗\NHow you doin'
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.54,0:24:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是监狱\NIt's prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.91,0:24:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,听好 我们需要你的帮忙\NLook We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说霍华德警监贪污\NThey're saying that Captain Howard was dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.71,0:24:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否有情报\NDo you know anything about that
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.67,0:24:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这个情报能让我减刑多少 我还在争取\NHow much time I get off for this one I'm still working on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.63,0:24:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我在告诉你 我需要你的帮忙\NThis is me telling you that I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.01,0:24:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要知道 霍华德警监是否与贩毒集团合作\NI need to know if Captain Howard was working with the cartels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.61,0:24:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在调查那些有合作的人\NHe was onto the ones that were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.53,0:24:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他被追杀\NSo he got greenlit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.95,0:24:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 不\NWait no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.32,0:24:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不 霍华德警监被杀 是因为他在你母亲的暗杀名单上\NNo Captain Howard was killed because he was on your mother's hit list.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.41,0:25:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他是被加上去的\NHe was added to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.12,0:25:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的人希望看起来像我们做的一样\NYour people wanted it to look like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.33,0:25:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们希望他死去\NYour people wanted him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.50,0:25:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你说 我们的人 是什么意思\NWhatchu mean our people
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.84,0:25:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该小心\NYou should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.30,0:25:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你在玩游戏 但你连规则都不知道\NYou're playing a game and you don't even know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.55,0:25:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你那边有卑鄙的玩家 你乱说\NThere's dirty players on your side That's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.14,0:25:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 是谁\NWait who
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.22,0:25:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过他一次\NI saw him one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.81,0:25:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你能认出他吗 当然\NCan you ID him Sí.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.19,0:25:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,给我名字\NGive me a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.23,0:25:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他的名字\NI don't know his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.19,0:25:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我母亲\NMy mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.74,0:25:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是与他对接的人\NShe's the one who dealt with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.45,0:25:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道我们该让那巫女活着\NI knew we should have kept that damn witch alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.45,0:25:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯\NMarcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.62,0:25:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,愿她安息\NMay she rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄\NDude.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.09,0:25:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 老板\NHey boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.69,0:25:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,登陆 迈阿密市警察局\N嘿 老板\NHey boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.17,0:25:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,登陆 迈阿密市警察局
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.80,0:25:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,线人在联合特遣部队档案中 拿到了霍华德的所有记录\NOur man on the inside got all of Howard's records in the JTF file.\N登陆 迈阿密市警察局
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.15,0:25:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,线人在联合特遣部队档案中 拿到了霍华德的所有记录\NOur man on the inside got all of Howard's records in the JTF file.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.43,0:25:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑 手机 文件 所有一切\NComputers phones files all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.18,0:26:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道霍华德曾调查我们的行动\NWell we know Howard was onto our operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.60,0:26:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,只是不知道他查到多少 别错过任何线索\NWe just don't know how much he had We need to make sure we got every trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.14,0:26:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\NThat's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.64,0:26:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 老板\NHey boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.44,0:26:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,都是纸质文件 到目前为止都没问题\NIt's all the paper files They're clean so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.77,0:26:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,两个手机没问题 他办公室电脑是空的\NTwo phones had nothing His office computer was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.57,0:26:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他很小心 但是\NHe was careful But
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.82,0:26:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但他的旧个人笔记本电脑加密程度较弱\NBut his old personal laptop had weak encryption.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.20,0:26:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有了\NHere we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.18,0:26:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,【网络故障】
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.29,0:26:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 我们遇倒了 防入侵装置\NShit We tripped a fail safe.\N【网络故障】
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.76,0:26:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 我们遇倒了 防入侵装置\NShit We tripped a fail safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.87,0:26:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思 我们\NThe fuck you mean we
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.00,0:26:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,向外发送了数据\NSomething was sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.79,0:26:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,给谁\NTo who
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.19,0:26:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,短信 [已发送]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在追踪接收电话\NTracing the phone now.\N短信 [已发送]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.67,0:26:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,短信 [已发送]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.89,0:26:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,【霍华德警监】
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.39,0:26:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么\NWhat the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.56,0:26:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在从另一世界给我们发短信\NHe's texting us from the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.64,0:26:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他没有 马克斯\NNo he's not Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.06,0:26:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你看到这个\NIf you're seeing this
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.90,0:26:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我大概已经死了\NI'm probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.07,0:26:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NFuck
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.15,0:26:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我真倒霉\NFuck me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.91,0:27:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在我开始之前\NBefore I begin
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.91,0:27:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说一件事:\NI wanna say one thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.53,0:27:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我正让你们陷入致命的危险\NI'm putting you in mortal danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.29,0:27:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,各位\NBoys
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.00,0:27:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们组织内有内奸\Nwe got rats in our walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.46,0:27:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但我必须确保你们是我的坏孩子\NBut I gotta make sure you're my bad boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.01,0:27:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,可乐瓶巨人就是关键\NThe Coke bottle giant is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.34,0:27:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.34,0:27:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别相信任何人\NDon't trust anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.68,0:27:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么 什么意思 可乐瓶巨人\NWhat's that What does that mean The Coke bottle giant
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,弗莱彻\NFletcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.57,0:27:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,完了\NOh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.44,0:27:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他们\NThese are the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,应该给这些混蛋一枪 彻底解决\NWe should put a bullet in these motherfuckers Be done with it once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.08,0:27:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,林茨 我爱你 任由你处置他们当然好\NLintz I love you I'd like nothing more than to let you loose on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但死去更多警察对我们没有任何好处\NBut extra dead cops doesn't do us any favours here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.96,0:27:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,持续监视 看看他们是否有所行动\NKeep them under constant surveillance and see if they make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.69,0:27:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,【艺术走廊】
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.30,0:28:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,弗莱彻的仓库就在那条巷子\NFletcher's warehouse is right down that alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.59,0:28:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 我没打算告诉你这件事\NMike I wasn't even gonna tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.47,0:28:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那就别告诉我\NThen don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.68,0:28:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你一定要听 这很重要\NNo you gotta hear this This is big.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.52,0:28:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我死不了\NI can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.81,0:28:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.85,0:28:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我死不了\NI cannot die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.94,0:28:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,几周前你在我的婚礼上死得还不错\NMotherfucker you did a pretty good job of dying at my wedding a couple weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.11,0:28:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但我没死\NBut I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.61,0:28:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧\NWatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.11,0:28:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 马克斯\NHey Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.20,0:28:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 快 滚出马路\NHey Come on Get out of the road
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.54,0:28:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHey
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.79,0:28:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯\NHey Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.67,0:28:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,停\NHey stop stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.67,0:28:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯\NHey hey Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.38,0:28:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是疯了吗\NWhat are you some kind of moron
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.72,0:28:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,停\NStop stop stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.18,0:28:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,警察 停车\NPolice Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.72,0:28:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 老兄\NHey Bro
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.14,0:28:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点\NSlow down
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.35,0:28:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,走斑马线\NCrosswalk
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.77,0:28:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说话\NTalk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.86,0:29:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你要相信 迈克\NYou gotta trust Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.90,0:29:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,相信自己 相信宇宙\NTrust yourself Trust the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.28,0:29:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你够了 马克斯\NStop that shit Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.99,0:29:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的时间还没到 迈克\NIt's not my time Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.12,0:29:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好 你是说如果我对你的脸开枪\NOh okay So you're saying that if I shoot you in your face
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.54,0:29:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说你不会死\Nyou're saying that you won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.25,0:29:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,命运注定你不会朝我脸上开枪\NFate dictates that you won't shoot me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.63,0:29:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说你说了\NI'm saying I'm I'm saying that you saying
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.55,0:29:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我对你的脸开枪 你不会死\Nthat if I shoot you in your face are you saying you won't die
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,命运不做假设 迈克\NFate doesn't deal in hypotheticals Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.35,0:29:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 别站在马路中间
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.52,0:29:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我要报警了\NI'm gonna call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.14,0:29:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经到了 女士 别多管闲事\NThey're already here ma'am Mind your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.85,0:29:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,到海滩去吧\NJust go to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.69,0:29:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别再胡闹了 马克斯\NStop that shit Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.73,0:29:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 你把枪收起来了\NSee You're putting your gun away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.15,0:29:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他把枪收起来了\NHe's putting his gun away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.95,0:29:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\NOoh Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.54,0:30:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,专心点\NFocus man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.38,0:30:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我称这地方为黑人想象的创意空间\NYeah I call this place you know Creative Space for Black Imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.92,0:30:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,弗莱彻\NYou know that Fletcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.39,0:30:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\NOh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.18,0:30:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.60,0:30:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么地方\NWhat the hell is this place
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.43,0:30:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的画廊工作室 我现在是一名艺术家\NThis is my studio gallery I'm an artiste now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 你才不是艺术家\NPlease you ain't no damn artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.57,0:30:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要什么 霍华德警监\NWhat do you guys want Captain Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.86,0:30:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是 很遗憾听到他的遭遇 他改善了我的人生\NYeah I was sorry to hear what happened to him He helped turn my life around.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.70,0:30:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫我们找你谈\NHe told us to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.61,0:30:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好 跟我谈\NOkay Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.70,0:30:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚就和你谈了 那就说你该说的话\NI just talked to you Then say what you're supposed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.58,0:30:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经说了我该说的话 你没有\NI said what I'm supposed to say You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.37,0:30:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那告诉我该说什么 我已经说了我能说的话\NThen tell me what I'm supposed to say I've said all I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.25,0:30:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你在耍我们吗 豆秆\NFucking with us beanstalk
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.38,0:30:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯 别这样\NMarcus Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.63,0:30:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,霍华德警监救了我的命 我不会搞砸这事的\NCaptain Howard saved my life I'm not messing this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.42,0:30:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能说我该说的 直到你说了你该说的为止\NI can't say what I supposed to say until you say what you supposed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.39,0:30:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,直接告诉我们你该说的话\NFletcher just tell us what you supposed to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.93,0:30:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 听好了\NDumbasses Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.76,0:30:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,霍华德警监正在调查一件大事\NCaptain Howard was onto something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.23,0:31:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他不相信你们这笨蛋会解决 所以他联络了我\NHe didn't trust that you dumb fucks would figure it out so he contacted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.65,0:31:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们很笨 而我是天才\NBecause you're stupid and I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.94,0:31:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我用某个东西保护着那资料\NSo I protected the information in something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.32,0:31:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,用一个很美的东西\NIn something beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.96,0:31:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,再动一下你的脸 再动一下\NFlex your face one more time Flex it again
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.21,0:31:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我会打爆你的头\NI will blow your fucking head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.13,0:31:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你能停吗 拜托\NWould you stop Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.67,0:31:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在一个会永远活着的东西里面\NIn something that will live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.97,0:31:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你开枪了\NDid you shoot him
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.98,0:31:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为是我\NI don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.24,0:31:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\NFreeze
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.28,0:31:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯\NMarcus Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.19,0:32:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你中枪了\NYou hit
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.73,0:32:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\NNah ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.82,0:32:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,黑色软糖 没有人喜欢那玩意儿\NBlack jellybean Nobody likes that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.53,0:32:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\NWhoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.83,0:32:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 停止那蠢事\NHey Stop that stupid shit
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.63,0:32:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我没跟你开玩笑 停\NI'm not fucking with you Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.14,0:33:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\NNo No no No No
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.24,0:33:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我所向披靡\NI don't give a fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.87,0:33:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯 不要\NMarcus No No
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.56,0:33:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\NWhat are you doing
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.90,0:33:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来 但你不行\NI got this But you don't though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.69,0:33:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo No
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.32,0:33:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,马克\NMarc
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.49,0:33:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 我们走\NLet's go Let's move
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.33,0:34:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯\NMarcus
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,伯内特和劳瑞在11街向北移动\NBurnett and Lowrey are moving north on 11th.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.02,0:34:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,迈阿密警察 快开\NMiami PD Go
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.03,0:34:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么 我正在打击犯罪 宝贝\NWhat are you doing I'm fightin' crime baby
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.44,0:34:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\NFreeze
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.56,0:35:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\NMike
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.33,0:35:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前有过恐慌发作吗\NHave you ever had a panic attack before
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.41,0:35:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 没人恐慌发作\NWhat Ain't nobody have no damn panic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.71,0:35:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你的血压165/90了 出汗 恶心 看心理医生并不丢人\NYou're at 165 over 90 Sweaty Nauseous There's no shame in getting counselling.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.59,0:35:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好 谢谢你的关心 兄弟\NAll right Thank you Appreciate you brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.63,0:35:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 乖乖听医生的话\NMike let the man do his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.51,0:35:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,做得好\NGood job man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.93,0:35:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 迈克\NHey Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.43,0:35:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么会恐慌\NWhat the hell you panicking about
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.35,0:35:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想说\NI'm not speaking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.81,0:35:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了什么\NWhat'd I do
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.10,0:35:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个没事吧\NYou two all right
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.11,0:35:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克恐慌发作\NMike had a panic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.82,0:35:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有 迈克没事\NHe didn't Mike is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.03,0:35:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事\NWhat happened
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.32,0:36:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,丽塔 你不会相信这件事 但我们收到一个信\NRita you ain't gonna believe this shit But we got a text
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.24,0:36:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一个线报 我们收到线报称弗莱彻违反了假释规定\NA tip We got a tip that Fletcher had violated his parole.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.62,0:36:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们来这里\NSo we came down here
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.58,0:36:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,显然他陷入了一些与他无关的事\Nand obviously he was into some shit he ain't have no business.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.83,0:36:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的吗 马克斯\NIs that true Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.38,0:36:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我一直和迈克一起\NWell you know I was with Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.26,0:36:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在所有人中 你怎么会认为霍华德警监做不法之事\NHow could you of all people think Captain Howard was dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.01,0:36:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望这是真的\NI don't want this to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.68,0:36:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但做好自己的事 尊重证据对大家都有好处\NBut it would benefit all of us to do our jobs and follow the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.52,0:36:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为他蠢到把账户记在自己名下\NAnd you think he was stupid enough to put accounts in his own name.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.06,0:36:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他是被陷害的 被谁\NHe's being framed By who
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.69,0:36:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我们想要找出的答案\NThat's what we're trying to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.53,0:36:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,丽塔 拜托 你不会那么傻\NRita come on you're smarter than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.28,0:36:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 请别忘记你正和你的上司说话\NMichael please do not forget you're talking to your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.99,0:36:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力保护你\NI'm trying to protect you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.41,0:36:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有两个街区半径的录像\NI got no footage for a two block radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.87,0:36:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.08,0:36:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定毁了所有闭路电视和安保摄像头\NThey must've killed all CCTV all security cams.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.21,0:36:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也找不到\NI got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.29,0:36:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,至少他们没拍摄到你的恐慌发作\NAt least they ain't film your panic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.76,0:37:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,各位\NHey guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.38,0:37:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你恐慌发作了吗 没有\NYou had a panic attack No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.01,0:37:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你要的话 我能推荐一位好的辅导员 不用 东恩 谢谢\NIf you want I can recommend a good counsellor I'm good Dorn Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.10,0:37:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看 这是我拍的 一帧一帧看\NLook I shot this went frame by frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.35,0:37:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看这个\NCheck it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.98,0:37:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好 不在这里\NAll right Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.10,0:37:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,东恩 关了它 好\NDorn shut it down Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.61,0:37:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\NHey Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.61,0:37:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\NSo what is this
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.36,0:37:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不肯定\NWe're not exactly sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.53,0:37:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 哇\NWhoa Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.82,0:37:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\NThere you go There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.95,0:37:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好 现在我知道是你们\NAll right you fucks Now that I know it's you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.83,0:37:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的:\Nhere it is:
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.92,0:37:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道最高涉及到哪个高层 但我们这边有贪官\NI don't know how high up it goes but there's corrupt officials on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.13,0:37:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他们和贩毒集团合作\NAnd they're working with the cartel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.84,0:37:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,大约九年前 这一切开始变得很奇怪\NThis all started smelling funny about nine years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.01,0:37:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们准备突袭的那批毒品失踪了\NThat shipment of coke we were about to raid went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.80,0:37:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,上头一直阻挡我\NYou know I kept getting shut down from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.43,0:37:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我找了已退休的桑切斯和鲁伊斯\NSo I pulled Sanchez and Ruiz outta retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.64,0:37:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我让他们从旁调查\NI had 'em working on the outside you know
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.27,0:37:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一周后 他们在一场车祸中丧生\NThey were killed in a car crash a week later.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.94,0:38:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我很震惊\NThat shook me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.65,0:38:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我从未让你们俩插手\NAnd it's why I never brought you two in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.36,0:38:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你们原本可以救我 我却担心你们的安全 真丢脸\NWell shame on me for worrying about your asses when you coulda saved mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.24,0:38:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在由你们决定\NBut now it's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.04,0:38:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得2003年的逮捕行动吗\NRemember the bust back in 2003
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.62,0:38:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,142公斤摇头丸\N314 pounds of ecstasy
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.08,0:38:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我收在储存柜 没有记录在案\NWell I held onto the storage unit off the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.09,0:38:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是真正的文件所在的地方\NThat's where the real files are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.96,0:38:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭这些混蛋所需的一切\NEverything you need to exterminate these rat fucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.68,0:38:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,都在里面\NIt's in there
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.80,0:38:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们必须完成我无法做到的事\NYou're gonna have to finish what I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.39,0:38:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你们\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.81,0:38:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了 两位\NPlease boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.97,0:38:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是我最后的希望\NYou're my last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.27,0:38:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,2003年\N2003.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.19,0:38:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那是海地人 佐伊·庞德\NThat was the Haitians Zoe Pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.11,0:38:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的储物柜在哪里\NWhere was their storage locker
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.91,0:38:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\NI have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.62,0:38:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好 你们该去警察局调出我们的案卷原件档案\NAll right We need you guys to go down to the station and pull our original case files.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.87,0:38:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能找出储物柜在哪里\NThat'll tell us where the locker is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.41,0:38:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,低调并小心地做 我们不知道谁可以信任\NDo it quietly and be careful We don't know who we can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.13,0:39:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是大件事\NShit this is heavy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.13,0:39:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我有些很重要的事要说\NI just got something important to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.13,0:39:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我就直接说吧 澄清一下\NI'm just gonna come out with it Clear the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.05,0:39:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那个内奸不是我\NThe rat is not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.89,0:39:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 东恩\NThanks for that Dorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.02,0:39:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得安全多了\NI feel safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.27,0:39:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,【监狱 高度设防活动操场】
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.03,0:40:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们刚打算杀了我儿子\NThey just tried to kill my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.53,0:40:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,因为阿曼多可以证明霍华德警监是无辜的\NBecause Armando can prove that Captain Howard was innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.87,0:41:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,警监去世前正在调查这些受贿的警官\NCap was onto these dirty players.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.04,0:41:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼多告诉你的\NArmando told you that
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.50,0:41:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 这就是他们想杀死霍华德警监的原因\NYes It's the reason they wanted Captain Howard dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.42,0:41:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼多可以认出下令袭击警监的人\NArmando can ID the guy that ordered the hit on Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.13,0:41:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有名字吗\NHe have a name
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.13,0:41:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 但知道对方长什么样\NNo But a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.47,0:41:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们可以做到 好吗\NListen I know y'all can do this All right
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.10,0:41:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,转移阿曼多 带他去迈阿密一个安全的地方\NJust transfer Armando Get him to Miami Get him to a secure location.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.98,0:41:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们审问他 拿到他的证词 给他一些照片\NWe'll debrief him We'll get his testimony We'll get some pictures in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.65,0:41:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但请马上去做\NBut please do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.65,0:41:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人试图掩盖真相 而且他们不会停手\NThese guys are tryin' to cover their asses and they are not gonna stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.49,0:41:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了霍华德警监\NDo it for Captain Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.87,0:41:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对霍华德警监不利的证据确凿无疑\NLook the evidence against Captain Howard is overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.16,0:41:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我选择这样做 也是为了你\NIf I'm doing this I'm doing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.58,0:41:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们转移阿瑞塔斯吧\NAll right let's transfer Aretas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.30,0:41:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你陪他 把他带到迈阿密的冰屋 审问他\NYou'll accompany him get him to igloo here in Miami do a debrief.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.34,0:41:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但我是因为相信你 才冒这么大的风险\NBut I'm sticking my neck out and I'm trusting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.09,0:41:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他是骗人的 那我就完了\NIf he turns out to be bullshit then it's gonna be my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.81,0:42:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以别把我害了 迈克\NSo don't screw me Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.40,0:42:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.19,0:42:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.57,0:42:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事\NYeah
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.70,0:42:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到了佐伊·庞德的储物柜\NWe found Zoe Pound's storage unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.86,0:42:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去拿文件 然后收藏在我的船屋\NWe'll go get the files then take them to my houseboat for safekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.37,0:42:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好 继续 找到后告诉我\NAll right stay on it Let me know when you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.64,0:42:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,请交出你的枪支 枪械将于着陆后还给你\NPlease surrender your firearms They will be returned to you upon touchdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.78,0:42:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\NYou good
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.16,0:43:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好\NNever been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.28,0:43:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,大约需要45分钟\NIt's about 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.75,0:43:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 我没打算告诉你\NMike I wasn't even gonna tell you this
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.88,0:43:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但在我们在一起的前世之一\Nbut in one of our previous lifetimes together
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.05,0:43:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾是一只驴\Nyou were a donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.63,0:43:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我是你的主人\NAnd I owned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.55,0:43:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你很固执 迈克\NYou were a stubborn ass Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.39,0:43:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你过去常咬人和吐口水\NYou used to bite and spit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.97,0:43:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你很坏\NYou were nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.64,0:43:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不是好主人 因为我总会打你\NBut I was a terrible owner you know because I used to beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.44,0:43:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你不听话\NBecause you wouldn't listen for shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.94,0:43:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我打得让你感到羞耻 迈克\NAnd maybe I beat some kind of shame into you Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.86,0:43:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我意识到我伤害了你的灵魂\NAnd now I realise I was scarring your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.58,0:43:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你错过了午睡\NYou miss your nap
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.91,0:43:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 我在尝试向你道歉\NMike I'm trying to apologise to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.62,0:43:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你的小被子不在这里 但你可以闭眼休息\NWe don't have your blankie but you could just rest your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.96,0:43:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你当驴子时就是这样 好吧\NThat's exactly how you was as a donkey Mm kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.79,0:43:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那副鬼样子 我明白了\NThat's that shit there I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.92,0:43:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要我帮忙系安全带吗\NYou need some help with your seat belt
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.72,0:43:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 驴子\NNo Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.89,0:44:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 布莱恩特 我是布朗森\NHey Bryant this is Bronson.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.22,0:44:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人之后还要回去\NOther guys are on turnaround.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.60,0:44:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,坐好\NTake a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.92,0:44:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\NWhat's up
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.78,0:44:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,【设置自动驾驶】
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.23,0:44:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,读出来\NRead the lines.\N【设置自动驾驶】
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.70,0:44:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,读出来\NRead the lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.85,0:44:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,美国法警724航班 我们有紧急情况\NUS Marshal flight 724 we have an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.02,0:44:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的囚犯在迈阿密警察劳瑞和伯内特的帮助下越狱了\NOur prisoner has escaped custody with the aid of Miami PD Lowrey and Burnett.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.57,0:44:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有倒下的警员\NThere are officers down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.44,0:45:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,求救 他们冲着驾驶舱来了\NMayday mayday They are coming for the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.49,0:45:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我重复 他们正在劫持CH 47\NI repeat they are hijacking the CH 47.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.37,0:45:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,请所有地面单位回应\NAll ground units please respond
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.42,0:45:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把劳瑞的枪给我 收到\NGive me Lowrey's gun Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.02,0:45:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\NGo go
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.10,0:45:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,去找劳瑞\NGet Lowrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.15,0:45:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\NLet's go
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.64,0:46:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不惧暴风雨 王八\NWe welcome the storm motherfu
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.77,0:46:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,把我从这该死的牢笼里救出来\NGet me out of this fucking cage
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.23,0:46:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯\NMarcus
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.56,0:46:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\NMike
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.37,0:47:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,太重了\NIt's too heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.63,0:47:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,别放手\NDon't let go
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.63,0:48:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住驾驶杆\NGrab the stick
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.84,0:48:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会开飞机\NWhere the hell you learn how to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.01,0:48:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个毒贩 向右\NI'm a drug dealer man To the right
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.81,0:48:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他用了我的枪\NHe was using my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.52,0:49:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们究竟是怎么登上美国法警直升机的\NHow the hell did they get on a federal transport
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.02,0:49:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须分头行动\NWe need to split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.52,0:49:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要在一起\NWe're gonna stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.31,0:49:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说的\NSays who
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.53,0:49:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是在问你\NI'm not asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.11,0:49:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我在告诉你 我们要在一起\NI'm telling you We're stayin' together.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.24,0:49:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,别挡我的路\NFuck outta my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.74,0:49:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 哪里 放开我\NHey Where Get the fuck off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.12,0:49:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHey Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.70,0:49:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,听好\NLook.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.79,0:49:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你是唯一能指证幕后主使的人\NYou are the only person who can identify whoever is doing this
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.46,0:49:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们活下去的唯一方法 就是先抓住他们\NThe only way that any of us stays alive is if we get them before they get us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.55,0:49:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没有我们\NThere's no us There is no us
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.26,0:49:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NDamn.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.76,0:49:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,劳瑞的基因还真是让人头大\NThat Lowrey DNA is a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.84,0:49:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩的劲儿都这么大\NY'all some strong motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.18,0:49:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好 这样吧 大家放松 我数到三\NOkay Now look everybody unflex On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.52,0:49:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二\NOne Two
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.27,0:49:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\NThere you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.44,0:49:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,霍华德警监给我们留下了文件 这些文件会告诉我们是谁干的\NCaptain Howard left us files that's gonna tell us who's doin' this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.40,0:49:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,都在东恩那里\NDorn has 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.78,0:49:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只需要回到迈阿密\NWe just have to get back to Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.74,0:49:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好别拖慢我\NYou better not slow me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.00,0:50:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,丢了你们的电话\NLose your phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.91,0:50:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟紧我 否则我就让你自生自灭\NYou keep up with me or I leave you in the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.88,0:50:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你已来到我的世界\NYou're in my world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.14,0:50:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 我们必须想一想\NHey Mike Look we gotta think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.64,0:50:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你要跟他走 因为他是你的 儿子\NI know you wanna move with him you know because he's your son
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.94,0:50:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 别那样说\NWhoa whoa Don't air quote that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.78,0:50:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我没有 我只是说我知道你在尝试保护他\NNo I didn't I'm just sayin' I know why you tryin' to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.03,0:50:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他是 家人\N'Cause he family
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.24,0:50:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样做和刚刚没什么差别\NHey Movin' the air quotes down to your hips doesn't un air quote them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.24,0:50:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就直说他是我儿子吧\NJust say he's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.29,0:50:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他是你儿子呀 不\NHe's your son No no.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.33,0:50:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,手掌向上就像你试图说：噢 他其实不是我儿子\NPalms up is like you tryin' to say oh he's not really my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.54,0:50:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 你儿子走掉了\NOh Well your son's gettin' away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.63,0:50:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.64,0:51:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你的人在执行某任务 最好通知我们\NIf your men are on some kind of op you might wanna pull us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.85,0:51:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不然 这对他们来说不太好\NOtherwise it doesn't look good for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.98,0:51:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,朱迪\NJudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.07,0:51:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体的身份都确认了 对 但有三人下落不明\NYou ID the bodies Roger We got three unaccounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.07,0:51:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,劳瑞 伯内特和阿雷塔斯\NLowrey Burnett and Aretas.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.28,0:51:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这些混蛋 该死\NMotherfuckers Fucking
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.78,0:51:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.70,0:51:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好 听好了\NAll right Listen up
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.49,0:51:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有三名嫌疑人 他们都携带武器 而且很危险\NWe have three suspects armed and dangerous out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.75,0:51:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,给我把他们抓回来\NAnd I want them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.00,0:51:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\NLet's go
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.25,0:51:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 朱迪\NHold on Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.71,0:51:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,三个 嫌疑人\NThree suspects
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.59,0:51:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这里发生了什么事\NWhat do you think is happening here
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.59,0:51:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\NWhat do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.10,0:51:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,播放音频\NPlay the audio.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.14,0:51:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,美国法警724航班 我们有紧急情况\NUS Marshal flight 724 we have an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.48,0:51:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的囚犯在迈阿密警察劳瑞和伯内特的帮助下越狱了\NOur prisoner has escaped custody with the aid of Miami PD Lowrey and Burnett.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.31,0:51:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有警官倒下 求救\NThere are officers down Mayday mayday.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.52,0:51:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧 你不会相信迈克和马克斯会这样做\NCome on you can't possibly believe Mike and Marcus would do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.53,0:52:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己说的 劳瑞一心想让儿子出狱\NNah you said it Lowrey was obsessed with getting his son out of prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.45,0:52:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别急 朱迪\NSlow down Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.70,0:52:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不是迈阿密 塞卡达\NThis isn't Miami Secada.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.54,0:52:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是我的逃犯 全都是我职权管辖范围\NThese are my fugitives and right now the whole world is my jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.21,0:52:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们认识了一辈子 你怎么能这么说\NYou've known them your whole life How can you even suggest
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.71,0:52:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为这是迈克和马克斯策划的吗\NDo I think that Mike and Marcus planned this
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.00,0:52:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不是\NProbably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.42,0:52:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但当涉及到家人时 人们会做他们通常不会做的事\NBut people do things they wouldn't normally do when family's involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.13,0:52:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,根据我的经验 无辜的人不会逃跑\NIn my experience innocent men don't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.59,0:52:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能不能先分析 你能不能做好自己的工作\NCan we stop and think before Are you capable of doing your job
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.26,0:52:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我必须继续调查\N'Cause I need to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.23,0:52:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还活着\NThey survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.02,0:52:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\NWhat the fuck you mean they survived
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.57,0:52:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,现场没有尸体 美国法警将其视为搜捕行动\NNo bodies on site US Marshals are treating it as a manhunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.45,0:52:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人就是死不了\NThese guys just refuse to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.28,0:52:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是通缉犯\NThey're wanted men.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.12,0:52:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,执法部门和媒体现在是我们的朋友\NLaw enforcement and media are our friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.87,0:52:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,三名逃犯的追捕行动\NA manhunt for three fugitives
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.58,0:52:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在南佛罗里达州引起了轩然大波\Nis sending shock waves across South Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.58,0:52:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,弹道报告与从尸体中找到的子弹相符\NBallistic reports have matched the bullets recovered from the bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.29,0:52:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,鉴于最近发生的事件 您打算退出市长竞选吗\NAre you planning on dropping out of the mayor's race in light of the recent events
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.97,0:53:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,目前搜捕工作正在进行中\NThe manhunt is currently underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.80,0:53:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,联邦调查局正在协助美国法警逮捕这些人\NThe FBI is assisting US Marshals in bringing these men in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.06,0:53:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,劳瑞 伯内特和阿雷塔斯应被视为有武器且危险\NLowrey Burnett and Aretas should be considered armed and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.89,0:53:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人杀害了其他专业执法人员\NThese are individuals who have killed fellow law enforcement professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.31,0:53:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你看到什么 请及时举报\NIf you see something say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.11,0:53:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在道上悬赏\NPut a bounty on the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.70,0:53:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,通知城里每一个黑帮 让他们为悬赏而战\NGet it to every gang in the city and let them fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.95,0:53:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,五百万\NFive mil.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.33,0:53:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赶快去抓这些混蛋\NLet's go get these motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.30,0:53:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙太疯狂了 不是吗\NThe universe is crazy ain't it
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.14,0:53:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看我们\NLook at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.30,0:53:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,今早起床时没人料到我们会走到这一步吧\NI bet none of us thought when we woke up today this is where we'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.93,0:53:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你离开了监狱\NYou outta jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.73,0:53:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我俩要进监狱了\NWe goin' to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.44,0:53:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,命运真幽默\NThis shit is special.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.98,0:53:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\NMike
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.73,0:54:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么想对阿曼多说的吗\NIs there anything you would like to say to Armando
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.74,0:54:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么那样说呢 没有\NFuck you talkin' to me like that No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.32,0:54:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 就是现在 向你儿子说出来\NMike this is a moment Express with your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.54,0:54:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.54,0:54:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就对了嘛\NThat's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.76,0:54:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,为了什么 为了一切\NFor what For everything man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.93,0:54:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我爱的人都遭遇坏事 所以\NSeems like bad shit happens to anybody I love so
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.14,0:54:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始想也许我被诅咒了\NStartin' to think maybe I'm cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.10,0:54:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得\NI just feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.35,0:54:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是我连累了你\Nmaybe I cursed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.27,0:54:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有\NYou ain't fuckin' cursed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.27,0:54:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都会遇上不好的事\NBad shit happens to everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.28,0:54:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,从来都不是你一个人的事\NAin't always about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.86,0:54:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼多\NHey Armando.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.45,0:54:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不知我是否跟你说过 但几个星期前我死了\NI don't know if I told you this but I died a couple of weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.87,0:54:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾听到这个消息\NSorry to hear about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.04,0:54:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不 是我经历过的最好的事情\NOh no The best thing that ever happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.92,0:54:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那次经历太不可思议\NShit's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.33,0:54:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们\NBut y'all
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.84,0:55:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就是我活过来的理由\NY'all the reason I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.50,0:55:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.26,0:55:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,大家 抱一个\NEverybody bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.88,0:55:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来 抱一个 来吧\NCome on bring it in Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.55,0:55:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.51,0:55:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了 阿曼多\NThere you go Armando.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.39,0:55:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了 这就\NThere you go There you
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.10,0:55:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩这逃犯当得太不合格了\NY'all are some terrible fuckin' fugitives.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.57,0:55:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为自己是马克斯·温弗瑞吗\NSo what are you fuckin' Marcus Winfrey
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.94,0:55:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 看吧\NWhat Now see
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.53,0:55:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我们看起来很软弱 好像不知如何逃跑\NYou makin' us look soft like we don't know how to be on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.16,0:55:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,【第二修正案才是美国自己的国土安全部】
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.63,0:55:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,最好先给你找一身别的衣服穿\NBetter get you out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.50,0:55:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHey
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.21,0:55:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子真固执 就像他父亲一样\NThat boy hard headed Chip off the old block.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.53,0:56:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧我发现了什么\NWell what we got here
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.32,0:56:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,该隐 过来看看\NHey Cain come take a look at this
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.74,0:56:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些小伙子在干什么\NWhat are you boys doin'
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.29,0:56:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,小伙子\NBoys
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.79,0:56:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在偷我们的衣服 看起来是这样\NAre y'all stealing our clothes Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.25,0:56:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,种族主义\NFuckin' racism.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.00,0:56:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为我们是黑人 你们就觉得我们偷了你们的烂东西\NY'all think just because we Black we stealin' your shit
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.96,0:56:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是我自己的黑人服装\NNow these are my own Black clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.93,0:56:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我从我的黑人衣柜穿上的\Nthat I put on today from my own Black closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.85,0:56:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯 什么\NMarcus What
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.06,0:56:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看你衣服上写了什么\NLook at your shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.35,0:56:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,【外衫印刷字】纯种白人男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.65,0:56:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西怎么会在我的黑人衣柜\NHow'd this get in my Black closet
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.07,0:56:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不如你给我们唱一首瑞芭的歌\NWhy don't you boys sing us a little Reba song.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.91,0:56:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞芭 瑞芭 好\NReba Reba Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.78,0:56:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,请\NOh please.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.24,0:56:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那 因为他介绍瑞\NThat's 'Cause he put He put me on to Reb
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.62,0:57:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一首 你们想听哪首\NWhich one Which y'all Which one
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.79,0:57:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,唱你最爱的\NSing your favourite.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.96,0:57:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她有很多 因为她有许多热门歌曲\NOh she got plenty of them 'Cause she got hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.55,0:57:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是快节奏的歌吗 还是慢的 对 记得那首吗\NWas it the up tempo song Or the slow jam Yeah yeah remember the one
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.30,0:57:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是那首慢的 哥们 噢 好\NIt was the slow one nigga Oh okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.05,0:57:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,早上你伤害了我 是的 因为她受伤了\NYou hurt me in the morning Yes 'cause she was hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.26,0:57:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上你伤害了我 对了\NYou hurt me at night Yes yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.56,0:57:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但我已改变 改变\NBut I've changed Changed
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.94,0:57:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我很坚强 我是个女人\NAnd I'm strong I'm a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.02,0:57:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个坚强的黑女\NI'm a strong Black wom
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.44,0:57:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个坚强的女人\NI'm a strong woman
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.86,0:57:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 因为她不是黑人\NYeah 'cause she's not Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.40,0:57:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,然后\NAnd then
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.70,0:57:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你该怎么办\NWhat you gonna do
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.57,0:57:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你该怎么\NWhat you gonna d
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.16,0:57:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是瑞芭的歌\NThat ain't no Reba song.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.74,0:57:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是她的混音带里的\NIt's from her mixtape.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.88,0:57:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\NGoddamn it
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.88,0:57:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我们会还回来\NWe're sorry We'll bring it back
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.89,0:57:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有因为我们是黑人而偷你的东西\NWe're not stealing your shit because we Black
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.61,0:58:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否爱过她\NDid you ever love her
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.36,0:58:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.33,0:58:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈 你是否爱过她\NMy mother You ever love her
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.37,0:58:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在表达\NHe's expressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.92,0:58:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我肯定爱过她\NI definitely loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.08,0:58:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你出卖了她\NAnd then you sold her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.71,0:58:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我做错了\NI made some mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.51,0:58:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是你的错误\NLike me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.63,0:58:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我不是 等等 阿曼多\NYou know that is not what I was trying Now wait a damn minute Armando.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.34,0:58:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在努力弥补\NHe's trying to make up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.05,0:58:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他不欠你什么\NHe don't owe you a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.85,0:58:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好 等等 马克斯 你太严厉了\NAll right hold on Hold on Marcus You're just You're being aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.35,0:58:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我做爸爸很久了 他必须听的 迈克\NI've been a dad a long time He needs to hear this Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.39,0:58:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要一些严厉的爱\NHe needs some tough ass love.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.15,0:58:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼多 也许他确实亏欠了你\NArmando Maybe he does owe you something Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.53,0:58:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈被他骗了\NYour mom being deceived by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.44,0:58:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你出生在布满谎言的监狱里\NYou being born in prison in a web of lies
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.37,0:59:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这使你变成一个冷血杀手\Nthat turned your ass into a stone cold fuckin' killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.25,0:59:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你是一个杀手\NYeah You're a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.12,0:59:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但这男人由始至终是真诚的\NBut this man through it all has been nothing but solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.09,0:59:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么年度之父的废话\NThat's some father of the year shit right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.34,0:59:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\NIs it
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.22,0:59:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你那很烂的教养方式把卡车弄坏了\NYour wack ass parenting broke the truck.
