Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.93,1:08:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,士力架89\NSnickers89.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.10,1:08:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我很快就能回家了 宝贝\NAlmost home baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.02,1:08:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们开工吧 这里有很多事要做\NHey let's get to work We got a lot to get through here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.37,1:08:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到底要找什么\NSo what exactly are we looking for
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.87,1:08:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在寻找下令袭击警监的人\NWe're looking for the guy who ordered the hit on Cap.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.62,1:08:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼多可以认出他\NArmando can ID him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.30,1:08:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个混蛋就是我的白鲸\NThis fucking bastard has been my white whale.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.01,1:09:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,过去的九年 我一直想用鱼叉刺死这个王八蛋\NFor the last nine years I've been trying to harpoon the son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.30,1:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在看你们的了\NBut now it's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.58,1:09:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我走进你家 教你如何做毒品\NEy Ey Ey Do I walk into your house and show you how to make cocaine
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.87,1:09:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,将它放大\NBlow it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.13,1:09:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是他\NIt's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.64,1:09:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定\NYou sure
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.26,1:09:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个下令袭击的人\NThat's the guy that ordered the hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.93,1:09:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,找到名字了\NBam Got a name.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.14,1:09:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·麦格拉思 陆军游骑兵学校 反情报\NJames McGrath Army Ranger School counterintelligence.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.24,1:09:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·麦格拉思\N詹姆斯·麦格拉思 陆军游骑兵学校 反情报\NJames McGrath Army Ranger School counterintelligence.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.31,1:09:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·麦格拉思\N2005年之前一直部署在墨西哥\NDeployed in Mexico until 2005.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.37,1:09:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,2005年之前一直部署在墨西哥\NDeployed in Mexico until 2005.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.11,1:09:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,曾与缉毒局 国防部武官办公室合作\NWorked with the DEA Defence Attache's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.94,1:10:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\NOh shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.53,1:10:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他被你的朋友 贩毒集团扣为人质\NHe was taken hostage by your friends the cartel.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.12,1:10:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他 在胁迫下 供出了整个小队\NHe gave up his entire squad under duress
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.16,1:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这和酷刑无异啊\NIt's called torture man.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.45,1:10:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,整个小队只有他活了下来\NHe was the only survivor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.13,1:10:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,警监一直都有他的犯罪证据\NCap had him the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.80,1:10:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是不知道\NHe just didn't know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.93,1:10:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHello.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.01,1:10:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 是我\NHey It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.80,1:10:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 你在哪里\NDamn it Michael Where are you
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.81,1:10:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,丽塔 我们要过来 我们有证据霍华德警监是无辜的\NRita we're coming in We got proof that Captain Howard is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.10,1:10:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么证据\NWhat proof
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.15,1:10:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到杀了霍华德警监的人\NWe got the guy that had Captain Howard killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.32,1:10:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼多认出了他\NArmando ID'd him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.61,1:10:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是用直升机袭击我们的家伙 詹姆斯·麦格拉思\NSame dude that attacked us on the chopper James McGrath.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.82,1:10:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,丽塔 我们有多达十年的档案\NRita we got ten years' worth of files.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.49,1:10:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,警监死前一直在调查这些家伙 我们全部查到了 是一整个网络\NCap was investigating these dudes We got 'em all It's a whole network.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.95,1:10:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,明天我们就会交给你\NWe'll surrender to you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.41,1:10:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们该走了\NHey look we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.12,1:10:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 什么\NMichael what
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.00,1:10:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\NYou okay
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.50,1:11:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会过来\NThey're coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.05,1:11:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.26,1:11:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克说他们有证据 证明霍华德无罪\NMichael says they have proof that exonerates Howard
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.34,1:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,说明了一切\Nexplains everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.35,1:11:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否还爱他\NDo you still love him
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.73,1:11:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.31,1:11:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.02,1:11:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但我相信他\NBut I believe him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.65,1:11:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,小心就是了 宝贝\NJust be careful babe.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.32,1:11:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还去吃晚餐吗\NStill going to dinner
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.57,1:11:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.87,1:11:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们找到档案了\NThey have the files.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.16,1:11:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要让这看起来像贩毒集团 只说西班牙语\NWe need to make this look like cartel business Spanish only.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.25,1:11:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,弹药准备好了 出发\NAmmo's ready to go Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.59,1:11:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,【触发动作传感器】
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.72,1:11:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只需要一名人质 意思其余可射杀\NWe only need one hostage.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.02,1:11:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,完了\NShit Shit Shit
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.39,1:11:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我们有麻烦\NYou guys We got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.02,1:12:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,迈阿密指挥中心 有罪犯入侵居民家中\NMiami Central Miami Central 29 in progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.19,1:12:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了 那是我家\NOh shit that's my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.32,1:12:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,罪犯目标是同僚警察的家 请指示\NPlease advise MOS residence.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.57,1:12:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,立即回应\NRespond forthwith.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.95,1:12:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 糟糕 不 糟了\NFuck Oh fuck Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.54,1:12:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,快 克莉斯丁\NCome on Christine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.04,1:12:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,【未知来电】
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.25,1:12:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 派一个警队去我家\NShit Get a unit over to my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.96,1:12:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 雷吉 接电话 迈阿密指挥中心 又发生一起罪犯入侵事件\NCome on Reggie Pick up Pick up Miami Central we have another 29 in progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.43,1:12:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,请派警队到劳瑞警探的家庭住址\NPlease send units to Detective Lowrey's home address.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.31,1:12:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人倒下了\NEnemy's down
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.60,1:12:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,雷吉 敌人正在逼近\NReggie You got incoming.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.02,1:12:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,带家人到安全的地方 什么\NGet the family to somewhere safe What
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.69,1:12:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,马上去 是 长官\NNow Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.90,1:12:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事 怎么了\NWhat's happening What's going on
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.86,1:12:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有人闯进屋子 我要保护你们的安全\NThere's people comin' in the house I gotta keep y'all safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.37,1:12:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,请小心\NPlease be careful
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.37,1:12:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,雷吉 发生什么事 相信我 我爱你们\NOkay Reggie what's happening Okay Trust me I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.87,1:13:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 要命\NFuck Fuck
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.22,1:13:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在你后面 雷吉\NBehind you Reg
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.18,1:13:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\NOh damn
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.32,1:13:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这人是谁呀 他是我儿子\NWho the fuck is this guy That's my boy That's my boy
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.79,1:13:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒\NDamn
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.33,1:13:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\NCome on come on come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.77,1:14:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo no no
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.15,1:14:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\NHoly shit
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.07,1:14:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\NCome on come on
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.12,1:14:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\NHoly shit
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.08,1:14:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,把你们打得屁滚尿流 王八蛋们\NChitty Chitty Bang Bang motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.46,1:14:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我的零食就是你的 雷吉\NMe snacks is your snacks Reggie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.21,1:14:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 进去吧\NAll right come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.39,1:14:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 你看到吗\NMike did you see that shit
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.10,1:14:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,接电话\NPick up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.76,1:14:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 迈克\NWhoa Mike Mike Mike
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.27,1:14:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\NOne second.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.20,1:14:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莉\NCallie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.20,1:14:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我在电视上看到 我妈妈正在追捕迈克叔叔\NI saw it on TV My mom is after Uncle Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.66,1:14:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他不可能做了他们所说的一切\NThere is no way that he did everything that they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.66,1:15:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\NSweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.83,1:15:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一切会好起来的 嗯\NEverything is going to be okay Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.12,1:15:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那就好\NOkay Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.39,1:15:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 是我 快离开房子\NHello It's me Get out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.18,1:15:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莉和我一起 带她走 马上离开\NI've got Callie with me Take her and go Get out now
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.44,1:15:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莉 躲到我后面\NCallie get behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.65,1:15:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\NMike.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.41,1:15:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,克莉斯丁\NChristine
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.58,1:15:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,劳瑞先生\NMr Lowrey.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.21,1:15:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我在跟谁说话\NWho am I speaking to
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.59,1:15:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你知道我是谁\NI think you know who you're speaking to.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.09,1:15:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你儿子\NI need your boy
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.76,1:16:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,以及你敬爱的警监所藏匿的所有证据\Nand whatever evidence your beloved captain had squirrelled away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.60,1:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,用这些交换你的妻子\NAnd for that you can have your wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.69,1:16:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,稍后我会回电教你怎么做\NI'll call you back with instructions.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.61,1:16:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\NAw shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.98,1:16:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\NGoddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.49,1:16:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我会去\NI'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.29,1:16:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让我的生命有价值一些\NLet my life be worth something.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.33,1:16:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不行\NNever.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.25,1:16:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不行\NNever.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.26,1:16:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\NMike.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.93,1:16:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经知道了\NHe knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.18,1:16:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\NWhat do you mean
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.85,1:16:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经知道我们会来\NHe knew we were comin' in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.56,1:16:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他已知道我们有霍华德警监的档案\NHe knew we had Captain Howard's files.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.44,1:16:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道我们认出他\NHe knew we had ID'd him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.07,1:16:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么会知道\NHow
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.82,1:16:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一与你交谈过的人是丽塔\NOnly person you spoke to was Rita.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.11,1:16:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不是丽塔\NIt's not Rita.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.20,1:17:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她对男人的品味也太差了\NDamn she got bad taste in men.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.12,1:17:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,【未知来电】
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.54,1:17:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,司法部一直在调查迈阿密警察局的腐败问题\NJustice has been investigating the corruption in the Miami Police Department
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.75,1:17:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有报告称已故警监康拉德·霍华德\Nwith reports suggesting the late Captain Conrad Howard
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.42,1:17:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHello
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.63,1:17:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,指挥警员与毒贩合作\Nwas directing these elements in coordination with the cartels.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.05,1:17:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对霍华德的指控 间接针对劳瑞和伯内特\NAllegations against Howard which allude to include Lowrey and Burnett
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.63,1:17:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,包括帮助毒贩将毒品运到佛罗里达州\Nand the operation range from helping cartels move the product into the state of Florida
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.18,1:17:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,以及交出关键证人 销毁证据\Nas well as giving up key witnesses destruction of evidence
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.02,1:17:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至谋杀同事\Nand even the murder of fellow officers.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.85,1:17:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么事 我不知道\NWhat's going on I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.40,1:17:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,案件有了突破 我必须去警局\NThere's been a breakthrough in the case I need to get down to the station.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.94,1:17:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我要到那里去\NI'm gonna head down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.16,1:17:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你去\NI'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.17,1:17:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你在发短信给谁\NWho are you texting
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.67,1:18:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要和办公室联系\NJust Just gotta get in touch with the office.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.89,1:18:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,联合部队\NJTF.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.06,1:18:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,必须通知大家\NGotta let everybody know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.02,1:18:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别这样\NHey Honey Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.65,1:18:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你在干什么 停手\NHoney what are you doing Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.07,1:18:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么 停手\NWhat are you doing Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.86,1:18:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我 你在干什么\NLet go of me What are you doing
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.66,1:18:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还给我\NGive it back to me Give it back
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.52,1:18:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\NFuck
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.44,1:18:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 快起来\NHey hey come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.49,1:19:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\NYou okay
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.57,1:19:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看手机\NLook at the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.75,1:19:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你完蛋了 对吧\NYou know you done fucked up right
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.13,1:19:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\NYou all right
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.64,1:19:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.39,1:19:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么好抱歉的\NAin't got nothing to be sorry for.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.58,1:19:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会找到她的 警监\NWe'll find her boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.17,1:20:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,除了在场的人 我不相信任何人\NI don't trust anybody that's not standing right here right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.55,1:20:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们每多牵扯进来一个人\NEvery extra person that we involve
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.80,1:20:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,都会增加他们知道我们要来的可能性\Nincreases the likelihood that they know we're coming
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.56,1:20:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这增加了克莉斯丁和凯莉\Nwhich increases the likelihood that Christine and Callie
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.56,1:20:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,无法逃生的可能性\Ndon't make it out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.94,1:20:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着不要特警 法警和后援\NThat means no SWAT no marshals no backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.28,1:20:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我们\NIt's just us.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.16,1:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没想过事情会这样发展\NI never meant for it to go this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.79,1:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为事情会如何发展\NHow did you mean it to go
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.08,1:20:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,9/11之后 没有人关心毒品进入这个国家\NAfter 9/11 nobody cared about drugs coming into this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.96,1:20:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,为了确保边境安全 我们开始与毒贩合作\NSo to secure the borders we started to work with the cartels.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.17,1:20:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他们随时警告我们任何即将发生的恐怖活动\NAnd they kept us informed about any terrorist activity coming our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.01,1:20:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,效果很好 从那以后我们就没有再受到袭击\NAnd it worked We haven't had an attack since.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.26,1:20:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在保护这个国家\NWe were protecting this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.81,1:20:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀害警察 勾结毒贩将毒品带入国内而捞钱\NYou were killing cops and getting rich putting drugs into this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.35,1:21:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,丽塔 所以你就杀了霍华德\NRita That's why you killed Howard.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.73,1:21:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他盯上你了 你要掩饰罪行\NHe was onto you You wanted to cover your tracks.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.11,1:21:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是麦格拉思\NNo That was McGrath.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.94,1:21:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他失控了\NHe's out of control.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.61,1:21:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,丽塔 你听我说\NRita Just take a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.70,1:21:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我无意让这一切发展到这个地步\NI never meant for any of this to go this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.30,1:21:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想知道 你是否是真心的\NI guess I just need to know if it was ever real.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.34,1:21:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都是真心的\NIt was always real.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.51,1:21:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我慌了 失控了\NI panicked I lost control.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.14,1:21:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否爱过我\NDid you love me
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.77,1:21:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,爱过\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.73,1:21:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓\NI swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.85,1:21:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那表示\NWell that means
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.44,1:21:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 声音样本采集完成\NWe good We got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.61,1:21:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,99%声音匹配\N99% voice match.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.07,1:21:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全不在乎 你这废物\Nabsolutely nothing to me you piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.25,1:21:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是我\NHey It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.37,1:22:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事\NWhat the hell's going on
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.33,1:22:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你搞砸了 就是这回事\NYou screwed up is what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.21,1:22:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们暴露了 到了那里我会解释\NWe've been compromised I'll explain when I get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.05,1:22:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要转移人质 古巴 长期禁锢\NWe're moving the hostages Cuba Long term hold
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.09,1:22:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这样 在解决这问题时 劳瑞 伯内特和阿雷塔斯就不敢轻举妄动\Nto keep Lowrey Burnett and Aretas quiet while we sort this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.43,1:22:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我乘水上飞机来 天一亮就到\NI'm bringing a seaplane I'll be there at first light.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.31,1:22:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好 大家赶快收拾东西\NAll right pack this place up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.44,1:22:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所有设备和人员准备转移\NAll equipment and personnel prepare to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.61,1:22:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要将人质转移国外\NWe're moving the hostages out of the country.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.21,1:22:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手怎么了\NWhat happened to your hand
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.34,1:22:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他们称之为哥伦比亚美甲\NThey call that a Colombian manicure.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.94,1:23:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这酷刑的绝妙之处在于\NWhat's so great about it
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.02,1:23:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它能让你感受最大程度的痛苦\Nis it's the maximum amount of pain
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.07,1:23:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但又不会死去\Nbut you don't die.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.16,1:23:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你决定成为那个拿着钳子的人\NSo now you've decided to be the one holding the pliers.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.37,1:23:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都会崩溃\NEverybody breaks.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.00,1:23:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人\NEveryone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.87,1:23:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你丈夫\NYour husband
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.79,1:23:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,将会跪在我面前\Nis gonna kneel down in front of me
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.59,1:23:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,并求我饶了你们的命\Nand beg for your lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.67,1:23:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就会看着我杀掉他\NAnd then you're gonna watch me kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.09,1:23:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你不了解我丈夫\NYou don't know my husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.31,1:23:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没正式认识过 但是\NWell not officially but
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.89,1:23:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我期待再次和他见面\NI look forward to seeing him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.66,1:24:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,坏孩子\NBad boys Bad boys
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.33,1:24:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,唱嘛 迈克\NCome on Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.00,1:24:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,坏孩子\NBad boys Bad boys
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.93,1:24:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做\NWhatchu you gonna do
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.18,1:24:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.18,1:24:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人朝你袭来时 你打算怎么做\NWhat you gonna do When they come for you
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.10,1:24:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这就够了\NThat's enough dawg That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.27,1:24:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回头再继续唱\NOkay well we'll circle back on that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.54,1:24:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好 飞机准备好了 20分钟后开始行动\NAll right The plane is ready We roll in 20.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.54,1:24:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一座废弃的游乐园 应该没有平民\NIt's an abandoned amusement park There should be no civilians.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.33,1:24:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机将从南边降落 在这一边\NPlane is gonna land from the south On the one side.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.55,1:24:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯和我从飞机上进击\NMarcus and I will be on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.05,1:24:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼多则从水中潜进突袭 两侧\NArmando's gonna make his way in the water The two side.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.76,1:25:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,卡丽 丽塔 这条路是一进一出\NKelly Rita This road is one way in one way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.22,1:25:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们负责防守这路\NYou're holding that road.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.10,1:25:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,东恩 你控制空中\NDorn you're gonna control the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.81,1:25:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,无人机在空中 干扰已激活 通讯安全\NDrones in the air jamming is active comms are secure.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.94,1:25:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会以为 洛克伍德正乘着飞机前去\NAs far as they know Lockwood is on his way with the plane
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.74,1:25:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,准备将人质转移到古巴\Nto move the hostages to Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.11,1:25:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,当他们带着人质靠近飞机时 立即击毙劫匪\NThe second they get close to the plane with the hostages it's quick kills.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.49,1:25:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,消除所有威胁\NNeutralise all threats.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.29,1:25:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这些混蛋杀了很多好警察\NThese motherfuckers killed a lot of good cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.83,1:25:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们绑架了我的妻子和凯莉\NThey have my wife they have Callie.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.00,1:25:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还袭击了我们的家人\NThey attacked our families.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.75,1:25:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我们绝不能输\NWe not losing today.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.22,1:25:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.47,1:25:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机一降落 只要你搞小动作\NWe get on the ground you even flinch
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.01,1:25:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就会在0.24秒里死去\Nyou'll be dead in 24 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.18,1:25:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意\NI concur.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.14,1:25:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我在外面的平台上有一人把风\NI got one lookout on the platform outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.56,1:25:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,二号楼的屋顶上有一名狙击手\NI got one sniper on the roof of building two.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.36,1:25:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看\NTee those up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.82,1:25:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大家继续前进\NEverybody keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.28,1:26:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那些是什么 鳄鱼\NWhat are those Gators.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.36,1:26:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为这是一个废弃的鳄鱼公园\NI thought it was an abandoned gator park.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.07,1:26:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真的被人们遗弃\NAbandoned by humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.20,1:26:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,其实这是一个古老的游乐园\NIt's actually an old amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.70,1:26:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,它占地10英亩 2017年 飓风 艾尔玛 之后被废弃\NIt sat on 10 acres abandoned in 2017 after Hurricane Irma.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.67,1:26:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的主要景点是一只名叫杜克的白化鳄鱼\NTheir main attraction was an albino alligator named Duke
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.13,1:26:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,长16英尺 重900磅\Nwho was 16 feet long 900 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.63,1:26:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,据说它还在那里\NAnd legend has it he's still there
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.80,1:26:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\NFuck that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.86,1:26:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼多可是从水上突袭\NArmando's at his QTH.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.59,1:27:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,人质现在出来了\NHostages are coming out now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.43,1:27:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,除麦格拉思外还有三人\NMcGrath plus three.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.43,1:27:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,大家保持冷静\NEverybody stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.61,1:27:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\NMike.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.28,1:27:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 能击中吗\NMike do you have the shot
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.03,1:27:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我无法开枪\NNegative I do not have a shot I do not have a shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.54,1:27:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 他就在那边 我无法开枪\NMike he's right there I don't have it I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.38,1:27:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他们停下来了 为什么停下来\NThey stopped Why'd they stop
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.32,1:28:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.53,1:28:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.96,1:28:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼多 他们正在靠近你\NArmando they're closing in on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.71,1:28:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们看到他了 我不确定\NDo they see him I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.54,1:28:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 马上 现在是开枪机会\NMike now Your chance is now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.09,1:28:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能看见了他 知道我们在这里\NThey can see him They know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.05,1:28:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法开枪 不行 不行\NI don't have it Negative Negative Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.09,1:28:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要开枪\NYou gotta take the fuckin' shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.20,1:28:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼多暴露了\NArmando's burnt.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.54,1:28:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 全面出击 开始行动\NShit Full green Engage.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.12,1:28:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,卡丽 大家跟我上 快\NKelly get us there Go go go
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.11,1:29:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,【不得擅入】
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.37,1:29:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,【墨西哥玉米片】
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.99,1:29:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,【墨西哥玉米片】
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.48,1:29:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人 码头西侧\NContact west dock side.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.20,1:29:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,东恩 干掉那个狙击手\NDorn Take out that sniper
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.37,1:29:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,派出无人机\NSending the drone.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.79,1:29:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定\NGot him.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.32,1:30:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不要发癫 迈克\NNot now Mike
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.40,1:30:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不行\NNot now
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.30,1:30:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\NIt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.51,1:30:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你的错\NNot your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.52,1:30:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,做个男人 大胆点吧 迈克\NCut that bitch ass shit out Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.19,1:30:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我要可恶的迈克\NI need Nasty Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.78,1:30:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶的迈克\NNasty Mike
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.03,1:30:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,坏事发生了 但这并不意味着你很糟糕\NBad shit happens but that doesn't mean you're bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.95,1:30:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,做一头固执的驴好吗 这就对了\NDo that donkey shit a'ight That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.12,1:30:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就那样 就像那样\NThat shit right there That's that shit right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.12,1:31:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,坏孩子 坏孩子迈克 知道吗\NBad boy Bad boy Bad Boy Mike All right
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.00,1:31:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是邻里的大灰狼\NYou're the big bad wolf in the neighbourhood
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.54,1:31:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不坏意味着坏 但坏就意味着好\NNot bad meaning bad but bad meaning good
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.28,1:31:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,东恩 炸毁周边车辆 收到\NDorn take out the vehicles on the four side Copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.21,1:31:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快走\NGo go Move it
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.09,1:31:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我们被袭击 失去了卡车和外面三个人\NSir We're taking heavies We lost the trucks and three guys outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.22,1:31:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\NGoddamn it
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.47,1:31:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,设置两侧射击位置 让他们进来\NSet firing positions both sides Let 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.59,1:31:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,去\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.55,1:32:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,法警霍华德 弹药车现场的热信号显示发生爆炸\NMarshal Howard heat signature at the site of the AMMO van is showing explosions.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.43,1:32:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,预计抵达时间15分钟\NETA 15 minutes.
