Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.39,1:35:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,克莉斯丁\NChristine
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.86,1:35:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,克莉斯丁\NChristine
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.57,1:35:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.57,1:35:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕\NOh sh
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.11,1:35:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 让我来 不\NMike I got this No No no
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.16,1:35:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了 宝贝\NHere I come baby Here I come
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.20,1:35:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo No No
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.22,1:36:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯\NMarcus
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.51,1:36:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你后面\NWhat Behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.14,1:36:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\NOh shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.81,1:36:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我能搞定 迈克\NI got this Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.32,1:36:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是小鳄鱼而已\NIt's just Dukey baby.
