Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.83,1:36:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开吧 鳄鱼\NBegone gator.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.04,1:36:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该来这儿 小鳄鱼\NThis is not your place Duke.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.75,1:36:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我谴责你\NI rebuke you
