Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.65,1:39:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对\NYou're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.17,1:40:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 好 没问题\NCome here Okay Okay It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.93,1:40:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我最讨厌政客\NI fuckin' hate politicians.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.24,1:40:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,【法警】
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.06,1:40:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 走\NLet's move Go go
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.19,1:40:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,散开 带他们到楼上\NFan out Take the team upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.11,1:40:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,目标不在\NNo targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.74,1:40:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,去上面\NGo topside
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.76,1:40:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,【女儿凯莉的手链】
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.55,1:40:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好 这里\NOkay Okay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.55,1:40:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,放我下来 没事的\NPut me down It's okay Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.26,1:40:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗 还好\NYou okay Yeah Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.72,1:41:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.06,1:41:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.75,1:41:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我来过这里\NI've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.25,1:41:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\NOh shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.24,1:41:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么让他抓住你了\NHow did you let him catch you
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.65,1:42:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他真是太狡猾了 迈克\NHe's sneaky as hell Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.78,1:42:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你妻子正在争论\NYour wife and I were having a debate.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.74,1:42:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看来她对你的印象有些夸大了\NShe seems to have an inflated impression of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.75,1:42:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 嘿 宝贝\NMike Hey bae.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.46,1:42:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管如此 这已经是尽头了\NNevertheless this is the end of the road.
