Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.75,1:42:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你来选\NYou choose.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.34,1:42:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道的是 麦格拉斯先生\NWhat you don't know Mr McGrath
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.18,1:42:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们其中一人死不了\Nis one of 'em can't die.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.18,1:42:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说谁呢\NWho you talking 'bout
