Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.85,1:43:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\NAw damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.27,1:43:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,来 让我看看 不 迈克 你这王八蛋又朝我开枪了\NHere Let me check it Let me see No Mike Your donkey ass shot me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.77,1:43:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看 拿开你手 迈克\NLet me look at it Don't touch me with your donkey hooves Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.44,1:43:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\NDamn man.
