Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.74,1:43:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不 迈克 不\NNo Mike No.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.86,1:43:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,马克斯 让我看看\NMarcus Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.91,1:43:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了吗 克莉斯丁\NYou see that shit Christine
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.45,1:43:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我朝背心开枪 别再胡闹了 这个不重要好吗\NI shot you in your vest Stop bitchin' It don't matter Okay
