Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.02,1:43:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莉 我要你听我的\NCallie I need you to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.98,1:43:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你慢慢向右迈一步 向我走来\NI want you to step slowly to your right and walk towards me.
