Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.86,1:44:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\NMom.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.86,1:44:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 别开枪 妈妈 他救了我 停\NMom don't shoot don't shoot Mom he saved me Stop
