Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.44,1:44:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\NMom Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.24,1:44:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你中枪了吗\NAre you hit Are you hit
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.15,1:44:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\NI'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.24,1:44:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事\NYou good
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.75,1:44:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得很好\NYou did good You did good.
