Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.60,1:45:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.60,1:45:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在我改变主意之前\NBefore I change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.81,1:45:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\NLet's go Let's go Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.70,1:45:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你还好吗\NHey You good You good
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.28,1:45:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.62,1:45:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去\NTake this.
