Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.12,1:45:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.20,1:45:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了\NI got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.66,1:45:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,乖一点\NBe good.
