Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.42,1:46:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 这里有受伤的警察\NCome on come on We got injured cops here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.30,1:46:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你马上把命令书给我\NI need you to bring the writ to me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.38,1:46:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know I know I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.51,1:46:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么样了 他会挺过去的\NHow is he You know he'll pull through.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.69,1:46:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别吻他 克莉斯丁\NDon't kiss him Christine.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.10,1:46:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 下辈子 你就做我的一双鞋\NMike in our next life you coming back as a pair of my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.73,1:46:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我不会穿袜子\NAnd I ain't gonna wear no socks.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.53,1:46:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,还会踩着各种大便\NAnd I'mma step in all kind of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.11,1:46:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,迈阿密检察官 市长候选人亚当·洛克伍德\NMiami DA and mayoral candidate Adam Lockwood
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.51,1:46:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,以及前陆军游骑兵詹姆斯·麦格拉思\Nand former Army Ranger James McGrath
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.62,1:46:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,今天早上在交火中丧生\Nwere killed this morning in a firefight.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.45,1:46:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,据信洛克伍德和麦格拉思\NIt is believed that Lockwood and McGrath were the key links
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.66,1:47:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,才是迈阿密执法部门和贩毒集团之间的勾结人\Nbetween Miami law enforcement and cartels.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.62,1:47:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,已故霍华德警监完全无罪\NThe late Captain Howard has been fully exonerated.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.04,1:47:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,联邦调查局和迈阿密警察局目前正在追查同谋\NCo conspirators are currently being rounded up by the FBI and the Miami PD.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.67,1:47:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对被定罪的杀手阿曼多·阿雷塔斯的搜捕仍在继续\NThe search for convicted killer Armando Aretas continues.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.34,1:47:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,目前 逃犯仍然逍遥法外\NThe fugitive remains at large.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.56,1:47:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我的家人们\NHey hey hey My people.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.15,1:47:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,特蕾莎在哪儿 她和小马克斯在秋千旁\NWhere's Theresa She's with Little Marcus by the swings.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.07,1:47:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我刚要煮给你们吃\NHey I'm about you hook you all up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.82,1:47:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,刚要煮给你们吃 请 我们很饿了\NI'm about you hook you up Please We're starving.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.15,1:47:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,看这个\NWatch this.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.70,1:47:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,搭档\NPartner.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.28,1:47:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是要干什么\NWhat's all this
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.41,1:47:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要系围裙\NWhy you got on an apron
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.54,1:47:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,锻炼我的烧烤技巧\NWork on my grill skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.54,1:47:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不 迈克 你去找别的烤架\NNo Mike you gotta earn the grill.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.88,1:47:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这需要调味料和温度 你不能直接用我的烤架\NThis takes seasonings and temperatures You can't just be cooking on my grill.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.84,1:47:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你的烤架 好笑了 这可是公共公园\NYour grill Joker this is a public park.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.92,1:47:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你先看到的烤架并不是你的\NYou don't own every grill you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.01,1:47:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不如你去做点土豆沙拉 摆放桌椅\NYou know what Mike Why don't you go make some potato salad and set the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.60,1:48:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,休想派我去做杂活\NOh you talking dirty.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.27,1:48:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧 我不知道你脑子想的\NNow look I don't I don't know what you got going on
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.64,1:48:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,烧烤独裁是怎么回事 但你小看我了\Nwith your barbecue dictatorship in your mind but I ain't the one.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.36,1:48:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你喜不喜欢 我要在这个烤架上做饭\NI'm cooking on this grill whether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.65,1:48:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 抱歉 长官们\NHey Mike Excuse me sirs.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.24,1:48:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么 雷吉\NWhat are you What you doin' Reggie
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.16,1:48:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,请求允许我煮鸡肉\NRequest permission to cook my chicken.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.83,1:48:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,许可被拒绝 雷吉 去找其他地方吧 伙计\NPermission denied Reggie Go ahead somewhere man.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.58,1:48:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,脱掉你的工作服 去和孩子们一起玩\NTake your smock off and go play with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.71,1:48:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 这是烧烤的男士区\NListen this is the man area of the barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.25,1:48:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言 我们很感激你拯救了我们所爱的人\NLook you know what All due respect we appreciate that you did save people that we love.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.55,1:48:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很感激 好吗 是的 很感谢\NWe appreciate that right Yeah we appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.09,1:48:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真心感激 雷吉 就是\NWe appreciate that from here Reggie Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.55,1:48:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你走开 没错\NNow back the fuck up Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.39,1:48:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好 这样吧 我愿意妥协\NAll right look I'm willing to compromise with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.48,1:48:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以用那一半的烤架 它很小 这一半我来用\NYou can work that half of the grill It's small And I'll work this half.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.69,1:48:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他还站在那里吗\NIs he still standing there
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.90,1:48:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\NYes he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.07,1:48:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好奇怪\NHuh that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.61,1:48:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.99,1:48:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他觉得他很强大\NHe think he hard now.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.57,1:49:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你该让那混蛋知道 他今天不能在这里煮鸡肉\NYou need to let that motherfucker know he ain't cooking no chicken out here today.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.04,1:49:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 他在屋内杀了15个人\NMike He killed 15 people at the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.71,1:49:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这事你管不了\NSo you not gonna handle this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.58,1:49:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我会让那混蛋煮鸡肉\NYeah I'm gonna let that motherfucker cook the chicken.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.88,1:49:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他眼中有些奇怪的东西 我去做土豆沙拉\NYeah there's something weird in his eyes So I'mma make the potato salad.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.35,1:49:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我来摆桌椅 好\NI'mma set the table Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.97,1:49:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,请求允许了 雷吉 你来吧\NPermission granted Reggie There you go.
